(6521635, 970173, 103032, '<td valign="top">Out of all the "ghostly" pics, this one is well done in that it creeps me out the best.  I think the exposure is just right in giving it that look of a ghost.  I also think the model was a great choice, along with the chair and the book prop.  I also like the grain and B&amp;W treatment.</td>', 'Out of all the "ghostly" pics, this one is well done in that it creeps me out the best.  I think the exposure is just right in giving it that look of a ghost.  I also think the model was a great choice, along with the chair and the book prop.  I also like the grain and B&W treatment.', '2011-08-31 03:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521674, 970087, 35467, '<td valign="top">Pity you left name on photo, you will proberbly get DQ, awesome capture.</td>', 'Pity you left name on photo, you will proberbly get DQ, awesome capture.', '2011-08-31 04:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521680, 970268, 114233, '<td valign="top">Clearly two of you went shooting together - which is perfectly fine. I prefer this one even though your building looks a bit wonky. Your technique is good and has resulted in a pretty noise free shot. I also love the way the clouds movement is perendicular to the movement of the stars. Woul dhave been nice to see perhaps just a bit more light inside the house / windows though. Overall good job!</td>', 'Clearly two of you went shooting together - which is perfectly fine. I prefer this one even though your building looks a bit wonky. Your technique is good and has resulted in a pretty noise free shot. I also love the way the clouds movement is perendicular to the movement of the stars. Woul dhave been nice to see perhaps just a bit more light inside the house / windows though. Overall good job!', '2011-08-31 04:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521683, 969892, 114233, '<td valign="top">Clearly two of you went shooting together - which is perfectly fine. I do however prefer the other shot. Something in your technique has let you down and the result is a very noisy image - probably not to most people''s liking but perhaps you wanted it to look that way?? Either this was shot with an ISO set way to high or you brightened it a lot in PP.<br/>The light inside the house / windows is a bit bright and overpowers the shot a bit. The sky is very noisy and doesnt seem to be focused very well. <br/>A great concept but lacking a little in execution.</td>', 'Clearly two of you went shooting together - which is perfectly fine. I do however prefer the other shot. Something in your technique has let you down and the result is a very noisy image - probably not to most people''s liking but perhaps you wanted it to look that way?? Either this was shot with an ISO set way to high or you brightened it a lot in PP.The light inside the house / windows is a bit bright and overpowers the shot a bit. The sky is very noisy and doesnt seem to be focused very well. A great concept but lacking a little in execution.', '2011-08-31 04:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521685, 969169, 114233, '<td valign="top">Nice effect and I am sure you had fun doing this one. The light trails on the sand / floor are a nice touch. Perhaps a bit of detail in the background to give this shot some context and a better composition (looks too central) would help. Would probably also have looked a bit better using the full 800 pix allowed.</td>', 'Nice effect and I am sure you had fun doing this one. The light trails on the sand / floor are a nice touch. Perhaps a bit of detail in the background to give this shot some context and a better composition (looks too central) would help. Would probably also have looked a bit better using the full 800 pix allowed.', '2011-08-31 04:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521686, 969873, 114233, '<td valign="top">Haven''t seen all the shots yet but this is my pic for the front page so far. Composition is more in quarters than thirds (on the vertical) and the tree is a little central. Not sure what other composition options you had though...<br/>Lovely shot and great work both in technique and PP</td>', 'Haven''t seen all the shots yet but this is my pic for the front page so far. Composition is more in quarters than thirds (on the vertical) and the tree is a little central. Not sure what other composition options you had though...Lovely shot and great work both in technique and PP', '2011-08-31 04:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521690, 970212, 114233, '<td valign="top">Might have been taken more seriously if the sparks were better placed... like travelling up the arm and not just randomly moved around the picture. Just a thought.</td>', 'Might have been taken more seriously if the sparks were better placed... like travelling up the arm and not just randomly moved around the picture. Just a thought.', '2011-08-31 04:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521692, 970114, 99181, '<td valign="top">A bit too high key for my usual liking, but it somehow works i think! Well done</td>', 'A bit too high key for my usual liking, but it somehow works i think! Well done', '2011-08-31 05:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521695, 969922, 99181, '<td valign="top">Yeees! This is what long exposures are all about for me: moody atmospheric seascapes. Fantastic capture, you''ve got it just right so as not to blow out the higlights on the water, which I often find to be an issue when you get foam from the waves. 9</td>', 'Yeees! This is what long exposures are all about for me: moody atmospheric seascapes. Fantastic capture, you''ve got it just right so as not to blow out the higlights on the water, which I often find to be an issue when you get foam from the waves. 9', '2011-08-31 05:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521712, 969507, 114233, '<td valign="top">Creepy! Intersting choice to make the "visitor" in color and the "normal person" in B&amp;W. I probably would have done it the other way around.<br/>If the "normal life" was more in focus / sharper / without that little bit of blur then it would have done much better.</td>', 'Creepy! Intersting choice to make the "visitor" in color and the "normal person" in B&W. I probably would have done it the other way around.If the "normal life" was more in focus / sharper / without that little bit of blur then it would have done much better.', '2011-08-31 06:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521714, 970195, 114233, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully artistic shot. Pity her right arm (our left) is also moving a bit - but I hope this does well. I''m sure it wasnt easy to keep everything but the head still.</td>', 'Wonderfully artistic shot. Pity her right arm (our left) is also moving a bit - but I hope this does well. I''m sure it wasnt easy to keep everything but the head still.', '2011-08-31 06:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521718, 970087, 114233, '<td valign="top">Sadly this will end up with a DQ - read the rules... no watermarks allowed. Other than that:<br/>Nice composition and lovely star bursts in the lights.</td>', 'Sadly this will end up with a DQ - read the rules... no watermarks allowed. Other than that:Nice composition and lovely star bursts in the lights.', '2011-08-31 06:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521719, 970213, 114233, '<td valign="top">I''m in two minds about that rock / tree on the far left... Yes it gives the jetty some grounding but it also keeps pulling my eye away from the rest of the image. Would have like the jetty a bit sharper as well. I like the minimalism about it and overall I say nice shot!</td>', 'I''m in two minds about that rock / tree on the far left... Yes it gives the jetty some grounding but it also keeps pulling my eye away from the rest of the image. Would have like the jetty a bit sharper as well. I like the minimalism about it and overall I say nice shot!', '2011-08-31 06:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521721, 970276, 114233, '<td valign="top">Wow you picked a difficult set up... those rain drops on your lens are going to kill your score sadly. Maybe an umbrella could have helped?</td>', 'Wow you picked a difficult set up... those rain drops on your lens are going to kill your score sadly. Maybe an umbrella could have helped?', '2011-08-31 06:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521727, 969949, 114233, '<td valign="top">Lovely clarity but I have read on the internet by some waterfall photographers that you should first go and remove any stray twigs, leaves etc so the scene looks cleaner - I am affraid I have to agree with them here... bottom left. Still a nice capture though!</td>', 'Lovely clarity but I have read on the internet by some waterfall photographers that you should first go and remove any stray twigs, leaves etc so the scene looks cleaner - I am affraid I have to agree with them here... bottom left. Still a nice capture though!', '2011-08-31 06:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521728, 969913, 114233, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot but would have looked 1,000,000,000 times better if it was not so blury. Either your focus was off or your image stabiliser was still on when the camera was on the tripod or the tripod was not very steady (wind perhaps?)...</td>', 'Lovely shot but would have looked 1,000,000,000 times better if it was not so blury. Either your focus was off or your image stabiliser was still on when the camera was on the tripod or the tripod was not very steady (wind perhaps?)...', '2011-08-31 06:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521750, 970133, 128323, '<td valign="top">Hmmm..  It''s a nice shot but not really obvious where the long exposure is.</td>', 'Hmmm..  It''s a nice shot but not really obvious where the long exposure is.', '2011-08-31 07:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521752, 969503, 128323, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s a good one!</td>', 'Wow, that''s a good one!', '2011-08-31 07:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521761, 969505, 128323, '<td valign="top">This is nice--I like the whirlpools on the right side.  It looks like it was shot during the day--ND filter?</td>', 'This is nice--I like the whirlpools on the right side.  It looks like it was shot during the day--ND filter?', '2011-08-31 07:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521763, 970195, 128323, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and composition!</td>', 'Good lighting and composition!', '2011-08-31 07:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521764, 969507, 128323, '<td valign="top">Wow, very surreal.  Looks like two people watching a child do gymnastics?</td>', 'Wow, very surreal.  Looks like two people watching a child do gymnastics?', '2011-08-31 07:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521768, 969885, 128323, '<td valign="top">I love Milky Way shots, and you nailed this.  It really makes me wish I didn''t live in a dusty, smoggy city.  I need to move to Iceland or something.</td>', 'I love Milky Way shots, and you nailed this.  It really makes me wish I didn''t live in a dusty, smoggy city.  I need to move to Iceland or something.', '2011-08-31 07:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521770, 969724, 128323, '<td valign="top">Ha ha... Road?  Where we''re going we don''t need...  road...</td>', 'Ha ha... Road?  Where we''re going we don''t need...  road...', '2011-08-31 07:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521773, 970019, 128323, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot, but I think it suffers from a few things:  The shadow from (presumably) a bridge kind of chops the picture in half, the rock in the foreground is harshly lit, and the fishermen themselves are tiny and almost out of the frame.  This is a cool concept, and I think it would work if it were composed a little differently.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot, but I think it suffers from a few things:  The shadow from (presumably) a bridge kind of chops the picture in half, the rock in the foreground is harshly lit, and the fishermen themselves are tiny and almost out of the frame.  This is a cool concept, and I think it would work if it were composed a little differently.', '2011-08-31 07:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521774, 969873, 128323, '<td valign="top">Wow--- I love the contrast of stillness versus speed in this one.</td>', 'Wow--- I love the contrast of stillness versus speed in this one.', '2011-08-31 07:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521776, 969497, 128323, '<td valign="top">I was hoping to see a ferris wheel somewhere in this challenge.  Great capture!</td>', 'I was hoping to see a ferris wheel somewhere in this challenge.  Great capture!', '2011-08-31 07:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521777, 970143, 128323, '<td valign="top">Heavenly!</td>', 'Heavenly!', '2011-08-31 07:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521779, 970114, 128323, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea... this looks like those 1950''s nuclear blast movies, where it gets bright, then two seconds later, the paint is sucked off all of the houses!</td>', 'Interesting idea... this looks like those 1950''s nuclear blast movies, where it gets bright, then two seconds later, the paint is sucked off all of the houses!', '2011-08-31 08:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521790, 970268, 128323, '<td valign="top">Wow, I think I just saw this exact building in voting.  Good shot though!</td>', 'Wow, I think I just saw this exact building in voting.  Good shot though!', '2011-08-31 08:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521803, 969497, 73942, '<td valign="top">I love these ferris wheel shots and have never been able to pull one off, this one is fantastic, perfect exposure and angle</td>', 'I love these ferris wheel shots and have never been able to pull one off, this one is fantastic, perfect exposure and angle', '2011-08-31 08:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521805, 970062, 73942, '<td valign="top">that is cool, and feels like you were awful close to it, you can almost feel it going by</td>', 'that is cool, and feels like you were awful close to it, you can almost feel it going by', '2011-08-31 08:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521838, 969587, 114233, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. I love how you managed to get alternating sides of the coin showing with each burst of the flash.</td>', 'Wonderful. I love how you managed to get alternating sides of the coin showing with each burst of the flash.', '2011-08-31 09:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521843, 970198, 114233, '<td valign="top">Sorry to hear the wind died... it could have been epic!</td>', 'Sorry to hear the wind died... it could have been epic!', '2011-08-31 09:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521846, 969594, 114233, '<td valign="top">This will likely end up in a DQ - no watermarks allowed. <br/>It is a nice flowing picture and the fradient from white to orange to red in flames is nicely controlled.</td>', 'This will likely end up in a DQ - no watermarks allowed. It is a nice flowing picture and the fradient from white to orange to red in flames is nicely controlled.', '2011-08-31 09:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521850, 970143, 114233, '<td valign="top">A reminder just how small and inconsequential we are in the greater scheme of things... oh and a lovely photo too!<br/>Its a wonderful documentary type of photo. I wish it had a bit of something here on earth too in the shot to show the scale etc... kind of like the other shot in this challenge.</td>', 'A reminder just how small and inconsequential we are in the greater scheme of things... oh and a lovely photo too!Its a wonderful documentary type of photo. I wish it had a bit of something here on earth too in the shot to show the scale etc... kind of like the other shot in this challenge.', '2011-08-31 09:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521860, 970089, 56978, '<td valign="top">You''ve torn me here; I like it even though I find the HDR a tad excessive....ah have a 7</td>', 'You''ve torn me here; I like it even though I find the HDR a tad excessive....ah have a 7', '2011-08-31 09:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521862, 969813, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the dreamy velvet water. :)</td>', 'I like the dreamy velvet water. :)', '2011-08-31 09:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521863, 969416, 15711, '<td valign="top">It makes the water quite painterly. :)</td>', 'It makes the water quite painterly. :)', '2011-08-31 09:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521864, 969711, 114233, '<td valign="top">Its always difficult to tell but looks slightly skew - down on the right hand side.<br/>Its so hard to do star trails overlooking city lights - it just washes out the sky and the lights overpower the stars too much.</td>', 'Its always difficult to tell but looks slightly skew - down on the right hand side.Its so hard to do star trails overlooking city lights - it just washes out the sky and the lights overpower the stars too much.', '2011-08-31 09:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521865, 969922, 15711, '<td valign="top">Terrific tonal range.  I like the mixture of textures as well. :)</td>', 'Terrific tonal range.  I like the mixture of textures as well. :)', '2011-08-31 09:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521866, 969737, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW Like a lightning family from big dad to little junior!!</td>', 'WOW Like a lightning family from big dad to little junior!!', '2011-08-31 09:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
