(6521869, 969871, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is almost edible, it''s so delicious.  The deep rich tones.  Love the "strings" of lights and the soft gauzy clouds.</td>', 'This is almost edible, it''s so delicious.  The deep rich tones.  Love the "strings" of lights and the soft gauzy clouds.', '2011-08-31 09:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521870, 969905, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh those clouds!!!</td>', 'Oh those clouds!!!', '2011-08-31 09:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521872, 969507, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh this is great.  I like how you oddly desaturated it.  This is quite artistic and a touch "avant garde."  Great stuff. I can see this in a contemporary gallery.</td>', 'Oh this is great.  I like how you oddly desaturated it.  This is quite artistic and a touch "avant garde."  Great stuff. I can see this in a contemporary gallery.', '2011-08-31 09:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
