(6528021, 969901, 27108, '<td valign="top">Aarrghh!.. hate to give this a 9, but I cant give it a 10 either!... just in the middle!... maybe a 9.6! ;)</td>', 'Aarrghh!.. hate to give this a 9, but I cant give it a 10 either!... just in the middle!... maybe a 9.6! ;)', '2011-09-04 23:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6528032, 970213, 27108, '<td valign="top">This is going to get a 10, but still hate how the horizon dont look like perfect!.. (it may be the "bridge" &lt;-- dont know the exact name, but it is going downwards, and this irritates my eyes.<br/> <br/>pd. beeing an Advanced Editing, you could probably have fixed it.</td>', 'This is going to get a 10, but still hate how the horizon dont look like perfect!.. (it may be the "bridge" <-- dont know the exact name, but it is going downwards, and this irritates my eyes. pd. beeing an Advanced Editing, you could probably have fixed it.', '2011-09-04 23:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
