(6528347, 970222, 110108, '<td valign="top">IMHO, sky is looking a bit dull and taking away from credit from the image.<br/>Never the less it is good.</td>', 'IMHO, sky is looking a bit dull and taking away from credit from the image.Never the less it is good.', '2011-09-05 01:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6528355, 970062, 107410, '<td valign="top">I love the idea and the colors. My only criticm is that the bus feels like it is going way too fast. I think that I personally would''ve preferred to see this with a slighly faster shutter speed so that the bus was still obviously in motion, yet it still retained a bit more of its original shape.</td>', 'I love the idea and the colors. My only criticm is that the bus feels like it is going way too fast. I think that I personally would''ve preferred to see this with a slighly faster shutter speed so that the bus was still obviously in motion, yet it still retained a bit more of its original shape.', '2011-09-05 01:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6528576, 969979, 114233, '<td valign="top">Looks like a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=59267" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">william88</a>'' sky! (Take that as a compliment! - sorry got the name wrong the first time, corrected now)<br/>Yes obviously a long exposure was used to capture this scene and the stars. Something is a bit weird with your PP. It looks like most of the vegitation is still but on the top right of the dark hill and right of the orange rock there is some funny blurring where hill meets sky. Will probably do quite well regardless</td>', 'Looks like a  william88'' sky! (Take that as a compliment! - sorry got the name wrong the first time, corrected now)Yes obviously a long exposure was used to capture this scene and the stars. Something is a bit weird with your PP. It looks like most of the vegitation is still but on the top right of the dark hill and right of the orange rock there is some funny blurring where hill meets sky. Will probably do quite well regardless', '2011-09-05 04:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
