(6541484, 969661, 135697, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Silent-Shooter:</b></div><hr/><i> Hmmm... Infrared without the channel swapping...<br/>Composition is good although that bright area just below the centre is probably the reason for your title... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>hehehe thanks... i could have done a little processing but anyway thanks! i would love the upgrade to the 5DMkII but am happy with the results so far..</td>', 'Originally posted by Silent-Shooter: Hmmm... Infrared without the channel swapping...Composition is good although that bright area just below the centre is probably the reason for your title...   hehehe thanks... i could have done a little processing but anyway thanks! i would love the upgrade to the 5DMkII but am happy with the results so far..', '2011-09-16 00:40:56.000000', NULL, 0),
